 "remarks": "Experience exceptional craftsmanship and modern luxury in this stunning 2023-built residence, offering 5 bedrooms, 4 full baths, and 1 half bath across four beautifully finished levels. Thoughtfully designed with custom millwork, sophisticated finishes, hardwood floors, and all-new systems throughout, this turnkey home seamlessly blends timeless elegance with today's most coveted amenities. At the heart of the home is a spectacular gourmet kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances, an oversized center island with seating, coffee bar, and walk-in pantry. The kitchen opens effortlessly to beautifully appointed living and entertaining spaces, creating the perfect setting for both everyday living and memorable gatherings. Bathed in natural light, the main level showcases a gracious living room with fireplace, elegant formal dining room with custom built-ins, and two private home offices, offering exceptional flexibility for today's lifestyle. The luxurious primary suite is a true sanctuary, featuring a spa-inspired bath, and oversized walk-in closet. The finished third floor offers outstanding bonus space with a spacious recreation room ideal for media, gaming, billiards, or play, as well as an additional bedroom and full bath. The lower-level features soaring ceilings and includes a large family room, fitness studio, full bath, abundant storage and ample space for recreation or guests. Outdoor living is equally impressive. A heated in-ground pool,",
